(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Instructions: Grow a bean in a jar.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising following and understanding instructions.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What instructions look like.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Instructions tell you how to do something. They have a title, a list of what you need, and numbered steps.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Read the instructions.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Read the instructions for growing a bean in a jar.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Find the command verb in: \"Pour a little water into the jar.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A command verb tells you what to do.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It is usually the first word of the step.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"Pour\" is the command verb.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is the purpose of this text?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "To tell you how to grow a bean": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "To tell a story about a bean": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "To sell beans": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "To describe a garden": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Look at the title.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Does it tell a story, or tell you what to do?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It starts with \"How to…\".": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It tells you how to grow a bean in a jar.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put the steps in the right order.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Look for the sequence words.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The jar needs paper before the beans go in.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Water comes after the beans.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Paper, beans, water, then a warm place.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort these words: command verbs or sequence words.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A command verb tells you to do something.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sequence words tell you when.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "first, next and finally show order.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "fold, pour and check are command verbs. first, next and finally are sequence words.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Why are the steps numbered?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "So you do them in the right order": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "To make the text longer": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Because numbers look nice": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "To count the beans": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Does the order matter here?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Could you water the beans before putting them in?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Numbers show the order.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The numbers help you do the steps in the right order.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The paper towel feels dry. What should you do?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Add a little water": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Throw the beans away": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put the jar in the fridge": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Add a lot of water": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Read the last step.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What does it say to do when the paper is dry?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"Add a little water.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Step 5 says to add a little water if the paper feels dry.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What helped you follow the instructions?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The numbers": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The sequence words": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Picturing each step": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Good instructions are clear, short and in the right order.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How to Grow a Bean in a Jar": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You will need: a clean glass jar, two paper towels, water and two bean seeds.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "First, fold the paper towels and press them around the inside of the jar.Next, push the bean seeds between the glass and the paper, so that you can see them.Then pour a little water into the jar to make the paper damp, but not soaking.Put the jar in a warm place that gets some light.Finally, check your beans every day. Add a little water if the paper feels dry.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "After a few days, you should see roots growing from the beans.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Instructions. steps that tell you how to do something.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Damp. a little bit wet.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Command verb. a word that tells you what to do.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
